td:first-child { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4b5563; } .la-highlight-row { border-color: rgba(244, 111, 44, 0.35) !important; background: rgba(244, 111, 44, 0.06) !important; } .la-highlight-row td:last-child { color: #f46f2c !important; font-weight: 700; } }\n@media (min-width: 768px) { .la-spec-table { min-width: 480px; } }\n.la-spec-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }\n.la-spec-table thead th { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.la-spec-table tbody td { padding: 0.7rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }\n.la-spec-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f9fafb; }\n.la-spec-table tbody tr:hover { background: #fef3eb; }\n.la-spec-table tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a2e; min-width: 200px; }\n.la-spec-table tbody td:last-child { color: #374151; }\n.la-highlight-row td { background: rgba(244, 111, 44, 0.08) !important; }\n.la-highlight-row td:last-child { color: #f46f2c !important; font-weight: 700; }\n.la-doc-download { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f46f2c, #e05a1e); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem 0; }\n.la-doc-download:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(244, 111, 44, 0.35); color: #fff; }\n.la-doc-download--secondary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e); }\n.la-features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; }\n@media (min-width: 640px) { .la-features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }\n@media (min-width: 1024px) { .la-features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }\n.la-feature-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; }\n.la-feature-card:hover { border-color: #f46f2c; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(244, 111, 44, 0.12); }\n.la-feature-card strong { display: block; color: #1a1a2e; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }\n.la-feature-card span { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }\n.la-breadcrumb { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n.la-breadcrumb a { color: #f46f2c; text-decoration: none; }\n.la-breadcrumb span { margin: 0 0.35rem; color: #9ca3af; }\n.la-cta-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center; }\n.la-cta-section h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; }\n.la-cta-section p { color: #d1d5db; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; }\n.la-cta-section a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; background: #f46f2c; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.25rem; }\n.la-cta-section a:hover { background: #e05a1e; }\n.la-seo-text { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 10px; }\n.la-seo-text h3 { margin-top: 0; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"la-product-detail\">\n<nav class=\"la-breadcrumb\">\n<a href=\"https://ledajans.com\">Ana Sayfa</a><span>›</span>\n<a href=\"https://ledajans.com/led-ekran/\">Ürünlerimiz</a><span>›</span>\n<a href=\"https://ledajans.com/ic-mekan-rgb-panel/\">İç Mekan Flexible LED Paneller</a><span>›</span>\n    Q1.86 Flexible İç Mekan LED Panel\n  </nav>\n<div class=\"la-product-intro\">\n<h2>Q1.86 Flexible İç Mekan LED Panel</h2>\n<p><strong>Q1.86 Flexible LED panel</strong>, silikon kılıf ve esnek PCB ile üretilen <strong>1.86mm piksel aralığına</strong> sahip iç mekan esnek paneldir. SMD1515 RGB tam renk ile <strong>288.906 nokta/m²</strong> yoğunluk sunar. 150°~180° bükülme, 7.5mm kalınlık, ≥3840Hz yenileme. Yükleme: MAX 6 pcs @5V 40A / MAX 12 pcs @5V 80A.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-product-badges\">\n<span class=\"la-product-badge la-product-badge--orange\">Esnek</span>\n<span class=\"la-product-badge\">1.86 mm</span>\n<span class=\"la-product-badge la-product-badge--orange\">≥3840Hz</span>\n<span class=\"la-product-badge\">288.906 nokta/m²</span>\n<span class=\"la-product-badge la-product-badge--orange\">150°~180° bükülme</span>\n<span class=\"la-product-badge\">7.5 mm</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-features-grid\">\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>Esnek Modül</strong><span>Silikon kılıf, esnek PCB, 150°~180° bükülme.</span></div>\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>Ekonomik Yoğunluk</strong><span>1.86mm ile 288.906 nokta/m² – büyük eğrisel ekranlar için.</span></div>\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>Düşük Güç</strong><span>Ortalama 8.3W/modül, 181W/m².</span></div>\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>SMD1515</strong><span>RGB tam renk, 172×86 modül çözünürlüğü, HUB75.</span></div>\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>Yükleme Kapasitesi</strong><span>MAX 6 pcs @5V 40A / MAX 12 pcs @5V 80A.</span></div>\n<div class=\"la-feature-card\"><strong>Kontrol Desteği</strong><span>VGA, DVI, kablosuz, Cat5 100m, fiber 15km.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-spec-header\">\n<h2>Q1.86 Flexible Teknik Özellikler</h2>\n<a class=\"la-doc-download\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1Zmr2zDTDJdrUmC9jkY7q3XDS1SMu9BYw\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Q1.86 Dokümantasyonu İndir (PDF)</a>\n<a class=\"la-doc-download la-doc-download--secondary\" href=\"https://ledajans.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Indoor-modules.zip\">DWG İndir</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-spec-table-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"la-spec-table\">\n<thead><tr><th>Parametre</th><th>Özellik</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Modül</td><td>Q1.86-I</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Modül Tipi</td><td>Esnek (Flexible) – Silikon kılıf, esnek PCB</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"la-highlight-row\"><td>Piksel aralığı</td><td>1.86 mm</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"la-highlight-row\"><td>Piksel Yoğunluğu</td><td>288,906 nokta/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Piksel yapılandırması</td><td>SMD1515 RGB tam renk</td></tr>\n<tr><td>LED türü</td><td>SMD1515</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Modül boyutu</td><td>G320 × Y160 × D7.5 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Modül ağırlığı</td><td>290 g ± 10 g</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Modül çözünürlüğü</td><td>G172 × Y86 nokta</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Modül Miktarı/m²</td><td>19.53 adet/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Min. Görüş Mesafesi</td><td>≥ 1.86 m</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Parlaklık</td><td>≥ 500 cd/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Kontrast Oranı</td><td>5000:1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Görüş Açısı</td><td>Y: ≥160°, D: ≥140°</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Parlaklık Uyumu</td><td>≥ 97%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Renk Uniformitesi</td><td>≤ ±0.003 Cx, Cy</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sürüş Modu</td><td>1/43 tarama</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Arayüz</td><td>HUB75 × 1 adet</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Güç Arayüzü</td><td>VH4P × 1 adet</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Giriş voltajı</td><td>4.5~5 V</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Güç besleme voltajı</td><td>AC 100-240 V, 50/60 Hz</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Maks. Akım</td><td>5.0 A</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Maks. Güç Tüketimi</td><td>25 W parça başına / 543 W/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ortalama Güç Tüketimi</td><td>8.3 W parça başına / 181 W/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sinyal İşleme Derinliği</td><td>14 bit</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Video kare hızı</td><td>50~60 kare/s</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Yenileme Hızı</td><td>≥ 3840 Hz</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Hatalı Nokta Oranı (Tam ekran)</td><td>PZ ≤ 1/10,000</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Hatalı Nokta Oranı (Bölge)</td><td>PQ ≤ 3/10,000</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Yere Kaçak Akım</td><td>≤ 3.5 mA/m²</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MTBF</td><td>≥ 5,000 saat</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bakım Modu</td><td>Ön Bakım</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Koruma Sınıfı</td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PCB Alev Dayanıklılık</td><td>UL94 V-0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Yükleme Kapasitesi</td><td>MAX 6 pcs @5V 40A / MAX 12 pcs @5V 80A</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bükülme Açısı</td><td>150°~180° (esnek modül)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td>-20℃ ile +40℃</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Çalışma Nem Oranı</td><td>%10-60, yoğunlaşma olmadan</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Depolama Sıcaklığı</td><td>-20℃ ile +60℃</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Depolama Nem Oranı</td><td>%10-60, yoğunlaşma olmadan</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Kontrol Sistemi Parametreleri</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Renk sıcaklığı</td><td>3000~21000 K, yazılım ile ayarlanabilir</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Parlaklık seviyesi</td><td>256 seviye, otomatik veya manuel ayar</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Kontrol Yöntemi</td><td>Bilgisayar, gerçek zamanlı, çevrimdışı, kablosuz, internet, vb.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PC İşletimi</td><td>Windows (XP, Vista), Win7/Win8, Win10</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Video Sinyali</td><td>VGA, DVI, RF, S-VIDEO, RGBHV, YUV, YC, KOMPOZİSYON, vb.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>İletişim Mesafesi</td><td>Cat5 UTP 100 metre, Çok modlu fiber optik 500 metre, tek 15 km</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-seo-text\">\n<h3>Q1.86 Flexible LED Panel Nedir?</h3>\n<p><strong>Q1.86 Flexible LED panel</strong>, 1.86mm piksel aralıklı, esnek iç mekan modüldür. 288.906 nokta/m² ve yüksek yükleme kapasitesi ile büyük eğrisel ekran projelerinde tercih edilir.</p>\n<h3>Q1.86 Flexible Kullanım Alanları</h3>\n<p>Eğrisel lobi ekranları, showroom, sütun kaplamaları ve reklam ekranları için uygundur.</p>\n<h3>Q1.86 Flexible Avantajları</h3>\n<p>1/43 tarama, 14bit, MAX 12 pcs @5V 80A yükleme ile esnek kablo düzeni sunar.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"la-cta-section\">\n<h3>Q1.86 Flexible LED Panel Fiyat Teklifi</h3>\n<p>Projeniz için Q1.86 esnek iç mekan LED panel teklifi alın.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+902122204004\">+90 212 220 40 04</a>\n<a href=\"tel:+905438795108\">+90 543 879 51 08</a>\n<a href=\"mailto:info@ledajans.com\">info@ledajans.com</a>\n</div>\n</div>"
